    "description": "This course aims to introduce basic concepts in project management to the engineering students. This equips the engineers to improve their employability in the industry and helps in their career growth. Some of the key concepts such as project integration, scope management, project planning, project budget & cost management, project risks and opportunities, communication and conflict management shall be covered. This module will enable students to define and plan a project with proper understanding of engineers' role."
